message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "ESP32-simple_sleep_timer: light sleep with timer wake-up"
abstract: "An ESP32 program that enters light sleep, wakes up on a timer, and measures the time it slept. Written in C with ESP-IDF and FreeRTOS, in VS Code with PlatformIO, at the Universidade de Brasília with Prof. Jones Yudi Mori Alves da Silva."
authors:
